      "Verified malformed other-tenant rows do not prevent a valid transfer with an identical replacement.",
      "Reduced F2 to a minimal fixture; verified baseline success, candidate API/CLI rejection, equivalent UPDATE relocation success, durable replay after successful controls, and changed-value rollback.",
